WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
The evidence contract makes
the decision reproducible.

00:00:03.307 --> 00:00:07.840
It joins the requirement, test commit,
build, fixture, run results

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.160
and defect disposition.
Missing artifacts remain unknown.

00:00:12.373 --> 00:00:15.120
Skipped required tests remain incomplete.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:18.240
A failed ledger invariant
blocks this case.

00:00:18.338 --> 00:00:23.040
Complete passing evidence makes the case
eligible for review; it does not supply

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:26.400
an entire banking release policy.
The release owner still

00:00:26.448 --> 00:00:30.160
considers required provider integration
and the other agreed checks.
